`ProtectedFullBankBridgeScratch.actual_physical_step_run G c b yb lv Mx` (generic in the level),
embedded by owner-5's `pEmb` (`bridgeH`, `bridge_advance_eq`, `OuterStartBank.actualPhysicalStart_*`
